ra%2C_2014-08-11%2C_DD_092.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Puente_de_la_Torre,_Londres,_Inglaterra,_2014-08-11,_DD_092.JPG","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=35484310","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"The <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tower_Bridge\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Tower Bridge\">Tower Bridge</a> is a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/bascule_bridge\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:bascule bridge\">bascule</a> and <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/suspension_bridge\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:suspension bridge\">suspension bridge</a> located in the center of London that crosses the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/River_Thames\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:River Thames\">River Thames</a>. Its name is taken from the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tower_of_London\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Tower of London\">Tower of London</a>, located nearby and has become an iconic symbol of London. The bridge was built between 1886 and 1894 and has a length of 244 m (800 feet) and the height of the towers is 65 m (213 feet). The 61 m (200 feet) long central span is split into two equal bascules than can be raised 86 degrees to allow the transit of ships. Otherwise the bridge is open to the traffic and to the pedestrians.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2014-08-11 10:23:41","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<span class=\"int-own-work\" lang=\"en\">Own work</span>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<bdi><a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q28147777\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"d:Q28147777\"><span title=\"Spanish photographer\">Diego Delso</span></a></bdi>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 4.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 4.0","source":"commons-desc-page"},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"true","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"LicenseUrl":{"value":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","source":"commons-desc-page"}},"mime":"image/jpeg"}]},"25454922":{"pageid":25454922,"ns":6,"title":"File:Tower Bridge Lights.jpg","index":1,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":6502667,"width":2826,"height":4239,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Tower_Bridge_Lights.jpg/960px-Tower_Bridge_Lights.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":640,"thumbheight":960,"responsiveUrls":{"2":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Tower_Bridge_Lights.jpg/1280px-Tower_Bridge_Lights.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail"},"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Tower_Bridge_Lights.jpg/960px-Tower_Bridge_Lights.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":640,"height":960,"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Tower_Bridge_Lights.jpg/1280px-Tower_Bridge_Lights.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail 2x"},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/33/Tower_Bridge_Lights.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tower_Bridge_Lights.jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=25454922","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"On <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tower_Bridge\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Tower Bridge\">Tower Bridge</a> at night","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2013-03-26 21:30:16","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<span class=\"int-own-work\" lang=\